# Code owners: the last rule matching the path is used.
# Copy this file to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @owner with real users
# or teams. Without a protected branch that requires code owner review, it
# only notifies, it does not block the merge.

# The whole repo, as a safety net.
*       @owner

# Areas with a different owner. Uncomment and adjust.
# /docs/  @owner
# /.github/  @owner
